imageStudio.help.references.body:
Depending on the model:
• start image (img2img): the model transforms a single image, the 1st one;
• multi-image editing: it reads several images ("image 1", "image 2"...) to edit or combine them;
• no use: the images are "ignored" (greyed out) and have no effect.
Extra images, beyond what the model accepts, are also "ignored".
